---
title: "US Evidence Chain — 1 Origin"
format: mermaid
prefix: US-EVIDENCE-
suffix: .mmd
---
flowchart LR
    A[Origin / Source] --> B[Program Identity]
    B --> C[Declared US Context]
    C --> D[Evidence Record]

    classDef evidence fill:#f8fff8,stroke:#3b7a57,color:#16351f;
    class A,B,C,D evidence;

    note1["Rule: record what is known, who stated it, when, and the source."]
    D --- note1

    subgraph FACTS[FACT / Economy]
      F1[Source fact]
      F2[Program or production fact]
      F3[Custody claim]
    end
    D --> FACTS
